#: main.cpp:17
msgid ""
"KLettres helps a very young child or an adult learning \n"
"a new language by associating sounds and \n"
"letters in this language.\n"
"5 languages are available: Czech, Danish, Dutch, French and Slovak."
msgstr ""
"KLettres axuda os cativos e os adultos a aprender \n"
"unha nova linguaxe por asociación de sons e \n"
"letras nesa linguaxe.\n"
"Cinco linguaxes están disponibles: checo, danés, holandés, fracés e eslovaco."

